b4da38df7d5915066979736406592417a3289250d7ed98564f8ae2c2ce6b74936f6c1a6de7f6741d7a0fbf9856f73b6c81c29ca6ffecaeb5a240fa579da1c53f  0001-Compose-Korean-syllables-in-the-preedit.patch
74cf823ef6eb4dcf106d76ca9f3d4a9cae6dbdf0d96b66fa257f678213431fbe8e55e8c8485c6a90628b896a9bcf17ccc058b33928230fdfc1bfad0b557d330b  0002-Pass-content-type-changes-on-to-Qt-Virtual-Keyboard.patch
